test.out
# A release's signature travels in its tag; a plugin.sig left by a local
# `w17ctl plugin sign` must never be committed (tools/release.sh refuses it).
/*/plugin.sig
# A plugin's src/gen is generated — pb, contract and feature constants — by
# `make gen` (`w17ctl plugin gen`). Nobody edits it and it is never committed.
/*/src/gen/
